}

homePage ..> GroupCreation
homePage ..> privacy
homePage ..> terms
GroupCreation ..> GroupCreatingSuccessful
GroupCreation ..> Group
Group ..> edit
Group ..> new
Group ..> groupEdit
page ..> layout


GroupCreation ..> AuthProvider : useAuth()
AuthProvider ..> firebase : initAnonymousAuth()
Group ..> calculateSettlements

Group ..> AuthProvider : useAuth()
Group ..> GetProjectData 
Group ..> DeleteExpense

GroupCreation ..> createGroup

edit ..> updateExpense
new ..> addExpense
groupEdit ..> updateGroup
groupEdit ..> updateUsers



@enduml